<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="maestro-report-contract" content="{{contract}}">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{title}} - {{date}}</title>
<style>
{{theme_css}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header"><div class="header-inner">
  {{brand_logo}}
  <!-- Default logo when the marker is left empty: Maestro lockup. An overlay fills the marker and deletes the default block below. -->
  <svg viewBox="0 0 232 48" style="height:32px" role="img" aria-label="Maestro logo"><rect x="2" y="8" width="32" height="32" rx="9" fill="#0a84ff"/><path d="M2 11 L5 4 L8 9 L11 4 L14 11" transform="translate(2 8) scale(2)" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/><text x="42" y="32" font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="24" letter-spacing="-0.5" fill="#ffffff">Maestro</text></svg>
  <h1 data-report-title>{{title}}</h1>
  <div class="meta">
    <div>Date: <b>{{date}}</b> · Govard <code>{{govard_version}}</code> · <code>{{host}}</code> · profile <code>{{profile}}</code></div>
    <div>Magento <code>{{magento_version}}</code> · PHP <code>{{php_version}}</code> · MariaDB <code>{{mariadb_version}}</code> · Redis <code>{{redis_version}}</code> · OpenSearch <code>{{opensearch_version}}</code> · {{fpc}}</div>
    <div>Lint audit <code>{{lint_session}}</code> · <b>{{lint_findings}}</b> findings · <b>{{lint_duration}}</b> · {{lint_size}}</div>
  </div>
</div></div>
<div class="container">

<div class="kpi">
  <div class="box"><div class="label">Infra</div><div class="value">{{infra_verdict}}</div><div class="sub">{{infra_sub}}</div></div>
  <div class="box"><div class="label">Cache</div><div class="value">{{cache_verdict}}</div><div class="sub">{{cache_sub}}</div></div>
  <div class="box"><div class="label">Indexer</div><div class="value">{{indexer_verdict}}</div><div class="sub">{{indexer_sub}}</div></div>
  <div class="box"><div class="label">Cron</div><div class="value">{{cron_verdict}}</div><div class="sub">{{cron_sub}}</div></div>
  <div class="box"><div class="label">DB slow ≥1s</div><div class="value">{{db_slow}}</div><div class="sub">{{db_slow_sub}}</div></div>
  <div class="box"><div class="label">Lint findings</div><div class="value">{{lint_findings}}</div><div class="sub">{{lint_sub}}</div></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Verdict</h2>
  <p class="verdict" data-report-verdict>{{verdict}}</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>URLs Audited <span class="badge badge-gray">{{scope}} · {{page_count}} pages · double-pass</span></h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Type</th><th>URL</th><th>Queries</th></tr>
    {{urls_rows}}
  </table>
  <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:6px">{{urls_note}}</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Before/After Comparison Matrix <span class="badge badge-gray">same metrics · frozen URL set</span></h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Page</th><th>Query count</th><th>LCP cold</th><th>LCP warm</th><th>CLS</th><th>Performance score cold</th><th>Performance score warm</th></tr>
    {{comparison_rows}}
  </table>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">One row per page, each cell shows the before value and the after value for the same metric. Closed fixed column set: the column set extends only through a template update, never per report. A metric recorded on one side only is a gate failure, not a blank cell. The CLS column reports the cold value, so both sides stay comparable. Warm cells for legacy audits read <code>Skipped: legacy audit, cold only</code>; no re-audit is forced because the reason covers legacy data only. The legacy reason applies only to legacy data captured before warm measurement existed; a fresh audit using it for warm cells fails the gate.</div>
</div>
<!-- Baseline mode: with no prior URL set, replace the matrix card above with a note card reading `Baseline recorded: <date> - no prior URL set exists, comparison deferred to the next audit`. The step 10 gate accepts the baseline note in place of the matrix. -->

<div class="card">
  <h2>Infrastructure <span class="badge {{infra_badge}}">{{infra_status}}</span></h2>
  {{infra_checks}}
  <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px">Verdict: <span class="verdict">{{infra_verdict_text}}</span> - {{infra_verdict_detail}}</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Cache Status <span class="badge {{cache_badge}}">{{cache_status}}</span></h2>
  {{cache_checks}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Cache Invalidation Efficiency <span class="badge {{cache_inv_badge}}">{{cache_inv_status}}</span></h2>
  {{cache_inv_checks}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Client-Side AJAX Load <span class="badge {{ajax_badge}}">{{ajax_status}}</span></h2>
  {{ajax_checks}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Indexer Configuration</h2>
  {{indexer_checks}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Database</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Page</th><th>Queries</th><th>TIME max</th><th>TIME avg</th><th>≥1s</th><th>≥0.05s</th><th>≥0.01s</th></tr>
    {{db_rows}}
  </table>
  <ul>
    {{db_bullets}}
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Per-Page Query Detail <span class="badge {{perpage_badge}}">{{perpage_status}}</span></h2>
  {{perpage_details}}
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Deep: 7 pages unfiltered per-page tables (mandatory). Quick: Skipped matrix entry only. Each <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> shows total queries + distinct-shape count; tables are <code>Count | SQL (normalized)</code>.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Top Repeated Query Shapes</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Shape (normalized)</th><th>Count</th><th>Pages</th><th>Avg ms</th><th>Max ms</th><th>Evidence</th></tr>
    {{repeated_rows}}
  </table>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Top Timers <span class="badge {{timers_badge}}">{{timers_status}}</span></h2>
  {{timers_content}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Core Web Vitals <span class="badge {{cwv_badge}}">{{cwv_status}}</span></h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Metric</th><th>Cold</th><th>Warm</th><th>Status</th></tr>
    {{cwv_rows}}
  </table>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Cold is the first load after <code>cache:flush</code> expecting a cache MISS; warm is one immediate repeat load expecting a cache HIT; both record cache status response headers. Rows cover LCP, performance score, INP, and CLS, each with Cold and Warm columns, so LCP cold, LCP warm, performance score cold, and performance score warm are all recorded; INP is measured once on the cold pass.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Code-Level Performance Patterns</h2>
  <ul>{{code_patterns}}</ul>
</div>

<div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--red)">
  <h2>Recommendations <span class="badge badge-red">{{rec_count}} actions</span></h2>
  <ol style="margin:8px 0;padding-left:18px;font-size:13px">{{recommendations}}</ol>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Coverage Note <span class="badge badge-green">Self-verified</span></h2>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{coverage_note}}</div>
</div>

<div class="footer">Generated {{date}} from live govard captures on <code>{{host}}</code> (audit <code>{{lint_session}}</code> + per-page <code>{{perpage_session}}</code>). Logs retained <code>{{logs}}</code>. <a href="report.md">Markdown</a> · <a href="report.pdf">PDF via Print</a></div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
